{"key": {"text": "Number eight. The United Kingdom, scoring 0.1881. Its defense budget is about $88 billion, the sixth largest in the world, with 625 aircraft. Britain's army is small, but it has global reach. It operates two large aircraft carriers, and a fleet of nuclear-armed submarines, so that at least one is always at sea. Britain is one of only five countries officially recognized as nuclear powers under the Non-Proliferation Treaty. Its special forces, the SAS, are among the most famous in the world, and the Royal Navy is building a new generation of frigates to replace its older ships.", "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural", "rate": "-6%", "pitch": "+0Hz"}, "words": [{"w": "Number", "t": 0.106, "d": 0.253}, {"w": "eight.", "t": 0.372, "d": 0.239}, {"w": "The", "t": 1.051, "d": 0.04}, {"w": "United", "t": 1.104, "d": 0.426}, {"w": "Kingdom,", "t": 1.543, "d": 0.412}, {"w": "scoring", "t": 2.247, "d": 0.439}, {"w": "0.1881.", "t": 2.699, "d": 1.888}, {"w": "Its", "t": 5.027, "d": 0.12}, {"w": "defense", "t": 5.16, "d": 0.439}, {"w": "budget", "t": 5.612, "d": 0.372}, {"w": "is", "t": 5.997, "d": 0.173}, {"w": "about", "t": 6.184, "d": 0.319}, {"w": "$88 billion,", "t": 6.622, "d": 1.622}, {"w": "the", "t": 8.471, "d": 0.106}, {"w": "sixth", "t": 8.59, "d": 0.399}, {"w": "largest", "t": 9.003, "d": 0.598}, {"w": "in", "t": 9.614, "d": 0.067}, {"w": "the", "t": 9.694, "d": 0.08}, {"w": "world,", "t": 9.787, "d": 0.439}, {"w": "with", "t": 10.545, "d": 0.173}, {"w": "625", "t": 10.731, "d": 1.316}, {"w": "aircraft.", "t": 12.061, "d": 0.638}, {"w": "Britain's", "t": 13.152, "d": 0.293}, {"w": "army", "t": 13.457, "d": 0.386}, {"w": "is", "t": 13.856, "d": 0.106}, {"w": "small,", "t": 13.976, "d": 0.505}, {"w": "but", "t": 14.814, "d": 0.12}, {"w": "it", "t": 14.947, "d": 0.053}, {"w": "has", "t": 15.013, "d": 0.239}, {"w": "global", "t": 15.266, "d": 0.479}, {"w": "reach.", "t": 15.758, "d": 0.479}, {"w": "It", "t": 16.676, "d": 0.093}, {"w": "operates", "t": 16.782, "